  "story": {
    "title": "Not Green!!!",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Mia and Tia are friends. They are writing the 'NOT GREEN' list. They are writing things that are not green in color on their note.",
      "\"A cat is NOT GREEN!\" says Tia. Mia agrees, \"A cat can never be green\". They draw a cat on their note.",
      "\"Pumpkin is NOT GREEN! I have seen all of them are Orange,\" Mia says. They draw that too.",
      "Now Tia's turn. She says \"Clouds are NOT GREEN! They are black, grey or orange or red or white. But they are never green!\"",
      "Oh, no! Tia cannot get a thing that is not green. What can they do?",
      "Mia gets an idea. She says they can spot things that are not green using the books.",
      "They read the book and spot things that are always not green together. That bear is NOT GREEN!",
      "This dog and rabbit are NOT GREEN!",
      "These flowers are NOT GREEN! But that butterfly has green.",
      "This elephant is NOT GREEN!",
      "That dress is NOT GREEN! and the house and the shadow are NOT GREEN!!!",
      "It is a lot of fun to spot things that are NOT GREEN!!",
      "Can you also find NOT GREEN things in your book?"
    ],
    "sentences": [
